# French Suite No. 5 in G major, BWV 816: Bourree (J. S. Bach)
#
# Character: a brisk bourree in cut time, two beats to the bar, starting
# on a quarter upbeat. Eighth-note figures in both hands, the bass
# often in running arpeggios. Vigorous and rustic, with the bourree's
# strong half-bar pulse.
#
# Time signature: 2/2 (C barred), 30 bars in the Mutopia score and in
# the MIDI, with a quarter-note upbeat; bar 10 ends the first half on
# its third beat, and its last quarter is the upbeat to the second half.
# The MIDI plays each half once.
#
# Repeats: both halves repeated from their upbeats, written out with
# play. About 4 KB.
#   Performed bars: A 0.75-10.75, A repeat 10.75-20.75 (score x is
#   x+10), B 20.75-40.75 (score x is x+10), B repeat 40.75-60
#   (score x is x+30).
#
# Tempo: half note = 92, 60 bars with repeats, about 1:20.
# Track times: Angela Hewitt (Hyperion) 1:17, about half = 94 with both
# repeats; Murray Perahia (Sony) 1:19, about 91; Alessandra Artifoni
# 1:23, about 87; Glenn Gould (Sony) 0:46 (repeat plan unknown). 92
# sits between Hewitt and Perahia; eighths are about 9.8 frames each.
#
# Structure (my reading of the Mutopia score):
#   1-4     G major, the theme with its mordents; bass in eighths.
#   5-10    the theme again, moving to D major; cadence in D (10).
#   11-14   D major to E minor (dis, 13-14).
#   15-18   chromatic sequence (ais, gis), cadence in E minor (18).
#   19-24   C major and A minor, sequence in the bass.
#   25-30   G major, the long closing sequence and final cadence.
#
# Plan: each half full the first time, echoed on the repeat; the full
# sound returns for the closing sequence (score 25) in the last pass.

pickup 4

tempo 92 2

play 0.75-10.75 0.75-10.75 10.75-30.75 10.75-30

dyn 1 f            # A first time, from the upbeat
dyn 10.75 mp       # A repeat, an echo
dyn 20.75 f        # B first time
dyn 29 mf          # score 19-24: C major and A minor, a step down
dyn 35 f           # score 25-30: home to G
dyn 40.75 mp       # B repeat, an echo
dyn 55 f           # score 25 on: full for the close

rit 2 0.8          # the last two bars into the final G
